<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Formatting Demo</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
      color: #222;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .demo {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
    }
    .demo h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 19px;
      color: #1a3b5c;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }
    mark {
      background: #ffe066;
      padding: 0 3px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="demo">
    <h2>My Favourite App: Spotify</h2>

    <p>
      <b>Spotify</b> is my <i>go-to</i> app for music. I have been using it for
      <u>three years</u> now, and it has <mark>completely changed</mark> how I
      listen to songs. The free version is <small>decent</small>, but I switched
      to Premium and never looked back — ads are <del>annoying</del>
      <ins>gone</ins>, and downloads work offline.
      <br><br>
      What I love most is the <b>Discover Weekly</b> playlist. It uses
      <i>H<sub>2</sub>O</i>-level simplicity — you just tap play.
      Honestly, the recommendation quality is 10<sup>2</sup> times better than
      any other app I've tried. The interface is clean, the sound quality is
      great, and the <small>offline mode</small> saves my data every day.
    </p>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
